{"id":"352368d98a9342b6","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-finite-array.md","title":"强数组、弱数组与不交性","display":"df-finite-array — 强数组、弱数组与不交性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-finite-array","aliases":["20-df-finite-array"],"display":"df-finite-array — 强数组、弱数组与不交性","chapter":"5","section":"5.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.3.1(i)–(ii)","source_pdf_pages":[148,149],"source_printed_pages":[113,114],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-finite-array"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-finite-array</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-array — 强数组、弱数组与不交性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.3.1(i)–(ii)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>148</span><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>113</span><span>114</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(F=(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限自然数集合序列。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}array}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=D_{f(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=W_{f(n)}\\land |W_{f(n)}|&lt;\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ne m\\ [F_n\\cap F_m=\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}array}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=D_{f(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=W_{f(n)}\\land |W_{f(n)}|&lt;\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ne m\\ [F_n\\cap F_m=\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强数组能计算每列完整成员和最大值；弱数组仅统一枚举每个最终有限的列，不能有效识别列的终点。弱数组定义中有限性是要求，不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{f(n)}\">\\(W_{f(n)}\\)</span> 的形式自动推出。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.1(i)–(ii)；印刷页 113, 114；PDF 第 148, 149 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}array}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=D_{f(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\ [F_n=W_{f(n)}\\land |W_{f(n)}|<\\omega],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ne m\\ [F_n\\cap F_m=\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"W_{f(n)}","display":false}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"89b88563124855ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-array]]。"},{"id":"93cbfd6e6986f453","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。"},{"id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。"},{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-array]] — 章 5；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-array]]"}],"outgoing":["59004ac6d23e86f8","60af447f5d59a8dc"